# DotNetFoundry

A structured C# and .NET engineering laboratory built while
transitioning concepts from Swift and iOS development into the .NET ecosystem.

## Goals

- Master modern C#
- Understand the .NET runtime and tooling
- Build backend services with ASP.NET Core
- Learn Entity Framework Core
- Practice automated testing
- Explore software architecture
- Build production-oriented projects

## Learning Path

### Phase 1 — C# Fundamentals
- Types
- Variables
- Functions
- Classes
- Structs
- Records
- Interfaces
- Collections

### Phase 2 — Modern C#
- Generics
- LINQ
- Pattern Matching
- Delegates
- Async/Await

### Phase 3 — .NET
- Dependency Injection
- Configuration
- Logging
- Testing

### Phase 4 — ASP.NET Core
- REST APIs
- Authentication
- Middleware

### Phase 5 — Persistence
- Entity Framework Core
- PostgreSQL

### Phase 6 — Production
- Docker
- Architecture
- CI/CD
